{"symbol":"MCPL","yahoo":"MCPL.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Manoj Ceramic Limited","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Building Materials","website":"https://www.mcplworld.com","about":"Manoj Ceramic Limited provides trading, marketing, importing, and exporting of a diverse range of building materials in India and the United Kingdom. The company offers ceramic tiles, porcelain tiles, vitrified tiles, natural stones, marble, granite, sanitary fittings, and other allied construction and interior products. It also undertakes activities in architectural and interior design, space planning, turnkey interior solutions, project management, and other allied services. In addition, the company offers products such as wall and floor tiles in various sizes and finishes, artificial marbles, composite marbles, quartz stones, tile adhesives, sanitary ware, and faucets; and value-added services. It serves retail and institutional customers. The company exports its products in the United Kingdom, the United Arab Emirates, and Africa. Manoj Ceramic Limited was founded in 1991 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T12:58:47+00:00","quote":{"price":72.0,"prevClose":73.9,"marketCap":99.41,"high52":118.5,"low52":60.0,"pe":8.26,"bookValue":101.07,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":9.8,"shares":1.3807,"insiders":70.24,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2024-01-03","2024-01-04","2024-01-05","2024-01-08","2024-01-09","2024-01-10","2024-01-11","2024-01-12","2024-01-15","2024-01-16","2024-01-17","2024-01-18","2024-01-19","2024-01-23","2024-01-24","2024-01-25","2024-01-29","2024-01-30","2024-01-31","2024-02-01","2024-02-02","2024-02-05","2024-02-06","2024-02-07","2024-02-08","2024-02-09","2024-02-12","2024-02-13","2024-02-14","2024-02-15","2024-02-16","2024-02-19","2024-02-20","2024-02-21","2024-02-22","2024-02-23","2024-02-26","2024-02-27","2024-02-28","2024-02-29","2024-03-01","2024-03-04","2024-03-05","2024-03-06","2024-03-07","2024-03-11","2024-03-12","